---
import Entry from '../../../layouts/Entry.astro';
import { url } from '../../../lib/site';
import manifest from '../../../../public/data/charity-registry/netherlands/manifest.json';
import '../../../styles/charity-financial-search.css';

const title = 'Netherlands public benefit organizations (ANBI)';
const dataPath = '/data/charity-registry/netherlands/';
const grantsPath = '/record/funding-flows/netherlands-rijksfinancien/';
const count = (value: number) => value.toLocaleString('en-US');
const sources = [
  { title: 'Open data — Algemeen Nut Beogende Instellingen (ANBI)', publisher: manifest.publisher, url: manifest.catalogue },
  { title: 'Belastingdienst ANBI bulk XML archive (anbi.zip)', publisher: manifest.publisher, url: manifest.source.url },
  { title: 'Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Public Domain Dedication', publisher: 'Creative Commons', url: manifest.license },
];
---

<Entry title={title} eyebrow="The Record · Global Charity Index · Netherlands"
  summary="Search 54,361 Dutch public benefit organizations (ANBI) by name or nine-digit RSIN. Inspect active vs. revoked status, Cultural ANBI designation and statutory disclosure URLs."
  crumbs={[{label:'The Record',href:'/record/'},{label:'Global Charity Index',href:'/record/charity-index/'},{label:'Netherlands'}]}
  filePath="src/pages/record/charity-index/netherlands.astro" sources={sources}>
  <p>This edition indexes <strong>{count(manifest.counts.distinctOrganizations)} distinct nine-digit RSIN organizations</strong> from <strong>{count(manifest.counts.totalDecrees)} official decrees</strong> published in the Dutch Tax and Customs Administration (Belastingdienst) ANBI open-data export dated <time datetime={manifest.sourceCreatedOn}>{manifest.sourceCreatedOn}</time> (version <code>{manifest.sourceVersion}</code>, captured <time datetime={manifest.capturedOn}>{manifest.capturedOn}</time>). Of those, <strong>{count(manifest.counts.activeOrganizations)}</strong> hold active ANBI status (including <strong>{count(manifest.counts.culturalActiveOrganizations)} active Cultural ANBIs</strong>) and <strong>{count(manifest.counts.revokedOrEndedOrganizations)}</strong> carry an end or revocation date. Five additional statutory umbrella decrees without an RSIN cover Dutch public bodies and EU/EEA statutory ANBIs.</p>

  <section class="charity-financial-search" data-netherlands-registry data-base={url(dataPath)}
    data-grants={url(grantsPath)} data-manifest={JSON.stringify(manifest)} aria-labelledby="nl-search-heading">
    <h2 id="nl-search-heading">Search ANBI organizations</h2>
    <p id="nl-search-hint">Enter the beginning of a charity’s name (including working names without <code>Stichting</code> / <code>Vereniging</code>, e.g., <code>cordaid</code> or <code>oxfam novib</code>) or an exact nine-digit fiscal number (RSIN, e.g., <code>808298276</code> or <code>002872237</code>). Search runs locally in your browser.</p>
    <form aria-describedby="nl-search-hint">
      <label for="nl-query">Organization name or nine-digit RSIN</label>
      <div class="finance-actions">
        <input type="search" id="nl-query" maxlength="160" autocomplete="off" disabled />
        <span class="inline-field">
          <label for="nl-status">ANBI status</label>
          <select id="nl-status" disabled>
            <option value="">All statuses ({count(manifest.counts.distinctOrganizations)})</option>
            <option value="A">Active ANBI ({count(manifest.counts.activeOrganizations)})</option>
            <option value="R">Revoked or ended ({count(manifest.counts.revokedOrEndedOrganizations)})</option>
          </select>
        </span>
        <label class="inline-check"><input type="checkbox" id="nl-cultural-only" disabled /> Active Cultural ANBI only</label>
        <label class="inline-check"><input type="checkbox" id="nl-subsidy-only" disabled /> Has 2020–2024 subsidy name candidate</label>
        <button type="submit" class="btn" disabled>Search ANBIs</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-clear disabled>Clear</button>
      </div>
    </form>
    <p role="status" data-status>Search when you’re ready to load an ANBI shard.</p>
    <div class="finance-actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" data-json disabled>Export displayed results as JSON</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" data-csv disabled>Export displayed results as CSV</button>
    </div>
    <ol class="finance-results" data-site-symbol="tulip" aria-label="Netherlands ANBI organization results" data-results></ol>
    <noscript><p>Without JavaScript, use the <a href={manifest.catalogue}>official Belastingdienst ANBI open-data page</a> or download <a href={manifest.source.url}>anbi.zip</a> directly.</p></noscript>
  </section>

  <h2 id="funding">Follow central-government subsidies</h2>
  <p>The Dutch Ministry of Finance (Rijksfinanciën) publishes executed national budget recipients across ministries. <a class="identity-link" href={url(grantsPath)}>Search 2020–2024 central-government subsidies to Dutch foundations, associations and religious bodies</a>.</p>
  <p><strong>Identifier boundary:</strong> Belastingdienst indexes ANBIs by their nine-digit tax number (<code>RSIN</code>), while Rijksfinanciën indexes subsidy recipients by their eight-digit Chamber of Commerce registration number (<code>KvK-nummer</code>). Because no free bulk <code>KvK ↔ RSIN</code> crosswalk is published as open data, subsidy links flagged here ({count(manifest.counts.candidateSubsidyMatches2020to2024)} RSINs) are conservative unique normalized-name or name-and-city <em>candidates</em>—never statutory ID joins.</p>

  <h2 id="coverage">Coverage, revocations and statutory disclosure URLs</h2>
  <p>Every retained nine-digit <code>RSIN</code> passes the Dutch 11-proef check digit. Retaining revoked and ended ANBIs ({count(manifest.counts.revokedOrEndedOrganizations)} organizations across {count(manifest.counts.revokedOrEndedDecrees)} decrees) lets readers verify whether a charity’s tax-deductible status ended—and notice that in <strong>{count(manifest.counts.retroactiveEndBeforeRevocationDecrees)}</strong> of {count(manifest.counts.revokedOrEndedDecrees)} revoked decrees, the effective end date (<code>eindDatum</code>) precedes the administrative revocation date (<code>intrekkingsDatum</code>). <strong>{count(manifest.counts.multiDecreeOrganizations)}</strong> RSINs hold two decrees in the source XML (such as a prior revocation followed by reinstatement); this index surfaces the primary active decree while preserving the decree count.</p>
  <p>Dutch ANBI law requires recognized charities to publish their policy plan, board remuneration policy and annual financial statement on a public website; <strong>{count(manifest.counts.withSafeWebsiteUrl)}</strong> organizations include a valid HTTP(S) URL in this snapshot ({count(manifest.counts.websitePrefixedHttps)} bare domains prefixed with <code>https://</code>, and {count(manifest.counts.websiteBlankOrInvalid)} left blank where missing or malformed). Unlike registries that host centralized annual-return tables, Dutch ANBI financial disclosures remain decentralized across individual charity websites. <strong>{count(manifest.counts.withDistinctAlias)}</strong> organizations also publish a distinct working name (<code>aliasNaam</code>), and <strong>{count(manifest.counts.repeatedNormalizedNames)}</strong> normalized legal names are shared across more than one RSIN.</p>
  <p>Published by {manifest.publisher} under <a href={manifest.license}>CC0 1.0 Public Domain</a>. The <a class="identity-link" data-source-symbol="document" href={url(dataPath + 'manifest.json')} download>source manifest</a> pins the archive hash, XML hash, statutory umbrella list and all shard fingerprints. <a href={url('/record/charity-index/coverage/')}>Read the Index coverage</a>.</p>
</Entry>

<script>
  import { $, h } from '../../../lib/client/dom';
  import { download, toCsv } from '../../../lib/client/files';
  import { financialCsvName, financialShardLoader, normalizeFinancialName, type FinancialShard } from '../../../lib/client/financial-directory';

  type Organization = [
    string, string, string | null, string | null, 'A' | 'R', 'A' | 'R' | null,
    string | null, string | null, string | null, string | null, number, 'C' | 'N' | null,
  ];
  type DirectoryEntry = [string, string];
  type Manifest = {
    format: string; capturedOn: string; sourceCreatedOn: string; sourceVersion: string;
    publisher: string; catalogue: string; license: string;
    source: { url: string; sha256: string; bytes: number; xmlBytes: number; xmlSha256: string };
    names: Record<string, FinancialShard>; ids: Record<string, FinancialShard>;
  };
  type Result = { total: number; organizations: Organization[] };

  const stripDigits = (value: string) => value.replace(/[\s.-]+/g, '');
  const isRsin = (value: string) => /^[0-9]{9}$/.test(stripDigits(value));
  const bucketFor = (norm: string) => {
    const first = norm[0] ?? '';
    if (first >= 'a' && first <= 'z') return first;
    if (first >= '0' && first <= '9') return '0-9';
    return 'other';
  };
  const limit = 30;
  const toObject = ([rsin, name, alias, city, status, cultural, startDate, endDate, revokedDate, website, decreeCount, subsidyMatch]: Organization) => ({
    rsin, name, alias, city, status, cultural, startDate, endDate, revokedDate, website, decreeCount, subsidyMatch,
  });

  for (const root of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-netherlands-registry]')) {
    const manifest: Manifest = JSON.parse(root.dataset.manifest!);
    const base = root.dataset.base!;
    const grantsBase = root.dataset.grants!;
    const loadNames = financialShardLoader<Organization>(base, manifest.names);
    const loadIds = financialShardLoader<DirectoryEntry>(base, manifest.ids);
    const formEl = $<HTMLFormElement>('form', root);
    const input = $<HTMLInputElement>('#nl-query', formEl);
    const statusFilter = $<HTMLSelectElement>('#nl-status', formEl);
    const culturalOnly = $<HTMLInputElement>('#nl-cultural-only', formEl);
    const subsidyOnly = $<HTMLInputElement>('#nl-subsidy-only', formEl);
    const submit = $<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type=submit]', formEl);
    const clear = $<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-clear]', root);
    const statusEl = $('[data-status]', root);
    const results = $('[data-results]', root);
    const json = $<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-json]', root);
    const csv = $<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-csv]', root);
    let found: Result | undefined;
    let sequence = 0;
    input.disabled = statusFilter.disabled = culturalOnly.disabled = subsidyOnly.disabled = submit.disabled = clear.disabled = false;

    function reset() {
      found = undefined;
      results.replaceChildren();
      json.disabled = csv.disabled = true;
    }

    function statusSummary(row: Organization) {
      const [, , , , status, cultural, startDate, endDate, revokedDate, , decreeCount] = row;
      const parts = [status === 'A' ? `Active ANBI since ${startDate ?? 'unknown'}` : `Revoked/ended ANBI (start ${startDate ?? 'unknown'}, end ${endDate ?? 'unknown'}${revokedDate ? `, revoked ${revokedDate}` : ''})`];
      if (cultural === 'A') parts.push('Active Cultural ANBI');
      else if (cultural === 'R') parts.push('Ended/revoked Cultural ANBI');
      if (decreeCount > 1) parts.push(`${decreeCount} decrees in XML`);
      return parts.join(' · ');
    }

    function card(row: Organization) {
      const [rsin, name, alias, city, , , , , , website, , subsidyMatch] = row;
      return h('li', { class: 'card' },
        h('h3', {}, h('span', { class: 'identity-code' }, rsin), ' ', h('span', { lang: 'nl' }, name)),
        h('p', {}, `${city ?? 'City not supplied'}${alias ? ` · Alias: ${alias}` : ''}`),
        h('p', { class: 'note' }, statusSummary(row)),
        h('p', { class: 'note' },
          website
            ? h('a', { href: website, rel: 'noopener noreferrer' }, 'Charity ANBI disclosure URL')
            : 'No valid disclosure URL published',
          ' · ',
          h('a', { href: 'https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/nl/aftrek-en-kortingen/content/anbi-status-controleren', rel: 'noopener noreferrer' }, 'Check live Belastingdienst ANBI'),
          subsidyMatch
            ? h('span', {}, ' · ', h('a', { href: `${grantsBase}#q=${rsin}` }, `Inspect 2020–2024 subsidy name candidate (${subsidyMatch === 'C' ? 'name+city' : 'name only'})`))
            : ' · No unique 2020–2024 subsidy name candidate'));
    }

    async function search(value: string): Promise<Result> {
      const cleaned = stripDigits(value);
      const selectedStatus = statusFilter.value;
      const onlyCultural = culturalOnly.checked;
      const onlySubsidy = subsidyOnly.checked;
      const matchesFilters = (row: Organization) =>
        (!selectedStatus || row[4] === selectedStatus)
        && (!onlyCultural || row[5] === 'A')
        && (!onlySubsidy || row[11] !== null);

      if (isRsin(cleaned)) {
        const entry = (await loadIds(cleaned.slice(0, 2))).find(([id]) => id === cleaned);
        if (!entry) return { total: 0, organizations: [] };
        const org = (await loadNames(entry[1])).find(([id]) => id === cleaned);
        if (!org) throw new Error('The RSIN could not be matched to the shard.');
        return matchesFilters(org) ? { total: 1, organizations: [org] } : { total: 0, organizations: [] };
      }

      const query = normalizeFinancialName(value);
      if (query.length < 2) throw new Error('Enter at least two characters of a legal name or an exact nine-digit RSIN.');
      const queries = [query];
      const hasLegalPrefix = query.startsWith('stichting ') || query.startsWith('vereniging ');
      if (!hasLegalPrefix) {
        queries.push(`stichting ${query}`, `vereniging ${query}`);
      }
      const buckets = [...new Set(queries.map(bucketFor))];
      const organizations: Organization[] = [];
      const seen = new Set<string>();
      let total = 0;
      for (const bucket of buckets) {
        for (const row of await loadNames(bucket)) {
          if (seen.has(row[0]) || !matchesFilters(row)) continue;
          const normName = normalizeFinancialName(row[1]);
          const normAlias = row[2] ? normalizeFinancialName(row[2]) : '';
          const hit = queries.some(q => normName.startsWith(q)) || (normAlias !== '' && normAlias.startsWith(query));
          if (!hit) continue;
          seen.add(row[0]);
          total++;
          if (organizations.length < limit) organizations.push(row);
        }
      }
      return { total, organizations };
    }

    async function runSearch() {
      const ticket = ++sequence;
      reset();
      submit.disabled = true;
      statusEl.textContent = 'Checking the Belastingdienst ANBI snapshot.';
      try {
        const matches = await search(input.value);
        if (ticket !== sequence) return;
        found = matches;
        statusEl.textContent = matches.total
          ? `${matches.total.toLocaleString('en-US')} ${matches.total === 1 ? 'match' : 'matches'}. Showing ${matches.organizations.length}.`
          : 'No matching ANBI organization in this snapshot. Try the beginning of the Dutch legal name (often starting with Stichting) or exact nine-digit RSIN.';
        results.append(...matches.organizations.map(card));
        json.disabled = csv.disabled = !matches.organizations.length;
      } catch (error) {
        if (ticket === sequence) statusEl.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'The ANBI search failed.';
      } finally { if (ticket === sequence) submit.disabled = false; }
    }

    formEl.addEventListener('submit', event => { event.preventDefault(); void runSearch(); });
    clear.addEventListener('click', () => {
      sequence++;
      reset();
      submit.disabled = false;
      input.value = '';
      statusFilter.value = '';
      culturalOnly.checked = false;
      subsidyOnly.checked = false;
      statusEl.textContent = 'Search cleared.';
      input.focus();
    });

    const { format, capturedOn, sourceCreatedOn, sourceVersion, publisher, catalogue, license, source } = manifest;
    json.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!found) return;
      download('netherlands-anbi-organizations.json', JSON.stringify({
        format, capturedOn, sourceCreatedOn, sourceVersion, publisher, catalogue, license, source,
        total: found.total, organizations: found.organizations.map(toObject),
      }, null, 2) + '\n', 'application/json');
    });
    csv.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!found) return;
      const rows = found.organizations.map(row => ({
        ...toObject(row),
        name: financialCsvName(row[1]),
        alias: row[2] ? financialCsvName(row[2]) : '',
        city: row[3] ? financialCsvName(row[3]) : '',
        capturedOn, sourceCreatedOn, sourceVersion, publisher, catalogue, license,
        sourceUrl: source.url, sourceSha256: source.sha256,
      }));
      download('netherlands-anbi-organizations.csv', '\uFEFF' + toCsv(rows), 'text/csv;charset=utf-8');
    });

    const initial = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('rsin') ?? /^#q=([0-9]{9})$/.exec(location.hash)?.[1];
    if (initial && isRsin(initial)) {
      input.value = initial;
      void runSearch();
    }
  }
</script>
